<p>Hello,</p>

<p>Use this link to sign in to birbguessr:</p>

<p><a href="<%= @url %>"><%= @url %></a></p>

<p>Or type this code in the browser where you asked to sign in:</p>

<p style="font-size: 24px; font-family: monospace; letter-spacing: 2px;"><%= @code %></p>

